<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telemig 11-mo net 212.1 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telemig 11-mo net 212.1 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minas Gerais state telecom company Cemig issued the following statement on its preliminary January-November results.</p>
<p>			JAN-NOV 96	    JAN-NOV 95</p>
<p>    net oprtnl rvs   953 million		N/A</p>
<p>    net profit	 212.1 million	    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: No comparative and per share figures were provided. All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
